The order dated NEUTRAL CITATION C/SCA/7020/2022 ORDER DATED: 17/01/2024 undefined 03.05.2019 states the following facts that had been taken into consideration:-
(i) The family partition of the land in question was reflected in the Revenue Record of the land in question, however, the same was not given effect to the records of the District Inspector of Land Records, Bharuch (DILR);
(ii) The revenue records of the land in question was re- measured by the office of the District Inspector of Land Records, Bharuch (DILR) and Measurement Sheet was also prepared on 06.04.2019, that reflected that the Revenue Survey no. 182/6 (New Survey No. 688) reflects the name of the heirs of Hasanali Isamail as Occupier.

It is stated that the land being revenue survey No. 182/6-1 (New Survey No. 702) admeasuring about 6830 Sq. Mtrs. out of which 4200 Sq. Mtrs. had been acquired;
Sajid Ismail Hasan Ali vs Competent Authority, National Highway ... on 17 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/94491328/
